<title>USA: IndeNet sells Channelmatic.</title>
<headline>IndeNet sells Channelmatic.</headline>
<dateline>ENCINO, Calif. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>IndeNet Inc said Tuesday it sold its majority stake of its Channelmatic subsidiary to Sweden-based Limt Local Insertion Media Technology AB, for a total consideration of $10.91 million.</p>
<p>It said the purchase price consisted of $5.25 million in cash and $5.66 million in a combination of promissory notes and Limt capital stock. IndeNet had held a 67.66 percent stake in Channelmatic.</p>
</text>
